  "description": "Cross-language test vectors for the GET /enrollment attestation. The producer (packages/native-bcds-bridge, BLO-34022) and the page-side consumer (packages/window-multicast-bridge, BLO-34059) each hardcode this wire format; without a shared artifact a change on one side leaves the other silently never enrolling behind a green suite. Both sides read this file, so a change to the format fails a lane on whichever side moves first. The producer (src/identity.rs, `attestation_message_matches_the_shared_contract_vectors`) asserts attestation_message() reproduces `message` byte for byte and that each `signatureVerifies` / `derivesBridgeId` flag is accurate; the consumer (packages/window-multicast-bridge) reconstructs the message from the attestation fields and verifies each vector as it would one off the wire.",
